<title>USA: TENNIS-HINGIS WINS CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HINGIS WINS CARLSBAD WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1997-08-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the</p>
<p>final at the $450,000 Toshiba Classic women's tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat 2-Monica Seles (U.S.) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4) 6-4</p>
